":[{"id":"spn-16093","marks":["code"],"text":"GEOFLEETIC_BUILD_PROMPT.md"}]},{"id":"blk-16853","spans":[{"id":"spn-16094","text":"Elixir/OTP, CRDTs"}]}],[{"id":"blk-16854","spans":[{"id":"spn-16095","marks":["bold"],"text":"Agentelic"}]},{"id":"blk-16855","spans":[{"id":"spn-16096","marks":["code"],"text":"agentelic.com/project_spec/README.md"}]},{"id":"blk-16856","spans":[{"id":"spn-16097","marks":["code"],"text":"AGENTELIC_BUILD_PROMPT.md"}]},{"id":"blk-16857","spans":[{"id":"spn-16098","text":"Elixir/OTP"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-16858","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-16099","text":"Lower priority (marketplace/tooling, depends on others)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-16860","spans":[{"id":"spn-16100","text":"App"}]},{"id":"blk-16861","spans":[{"id":"spn-16101","text":"Spec"}]},{"id":"blk-16862","spans":[{"id":"spn-16102","text":"Prompt to Create"}]},{"id":"blk-16863","spans":[{"id":"spn-16103","text":"Implementation Stack"}]}],"id":"blk-16859","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-16864","spans":[{"id":"spn-16104","marks":["bold"],"text":"FleetPrompt"}]},{"id":"blk-16865","spans":[{"id":"spn-16105","marks":["code"],"text":"fleetprompt.com/project_spec/README.md"}]},{"id":"blk-16866","spans":[{"id":"spn-16106","marks":["code"],"text":"FLEETPROMPT_BUILD_PROMPT.md"}]},{"id":"blk-16867","spans":[{"id":"spn-16107","text":"Web app (TBD)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-16868","spans":[{"id":"spn-16108","marks":["bold"],"text":"SpecPrompt"}]},{"id":"blk-16869","spans":[{"id":"spn-16109","marks":["code"],"text":"specprompt.com/project_spec/README.md"}]},{"id":"blk-16870","spans":[{"id":"spn-16110","marks":["code"],"text":"SPECPROMPT_BUILD_PROMPT.md"}]},{"id":"blk-16871","spans":[{"id":"spn-16111","text":"CLI + web (TBD)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-16872","spans":[{"id":"spn-16112","marks":["bold"],"text":"OpenSentience"}]},{"id":"blk-16873","spans":[{"id":"spn-16113","marks":["code"],"text":"opensentience.org/project_spec/README.md"}]},{"id":"blk-16874","spans":[{"id":"spn-16114","text":"Research publication, not a codebase"}]},{"id":"blk-16875","spans":[{"id":"spn-16115","text":"N/A"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-16876","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-16116","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-16877","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-16117","text":"4) Codex Prompt Template"}]},{"id":"blk-16878","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-16118","text":"Each new prompt should follow this structure (based on what works in the existing prompts):"}]},{"id":"blk-16879","kind":"code","language":"markdown","text":"# [App Name] — Codex Build Prompt\nVersion: 1.0\nDate: [date]\n\n## Identity\n[What this app IS in 2-3 sentences. Role in [&] ecosystem.]\n\n## Architecture\n[ASCII diagram from project_spec. Key components and their responsibilities.]\n\n## [&] Capabilities\n[What capabilities this app provides/consumes. Contract references.]\n\n## Implementation Spec Reference\n[Point to project_spec/README.md sections]\n\n## Build Order\n[Phased task list, ~500-1000 lines per phase]\n\n### Phase 1: [Name]\n- Task 1: [description, inputs, outputs, acceptance criteria]\n- Task 2: ...\n\n### Phase 2: [Name]\n...\n\n## API Surface\n[Key endpoints, MCP tools, or CLI commands to implement]\n\n## Field Naming Conventions\n[From KAPPA_BUILD_PROMPT pattern — explicit field name rules]\n\n## Testing Requirements\n[What constitutes \"done\" for each phase]\n\n## Dependencies\n[Other [&] apps this depends on, and mock strategies when they're not available]"},{"id":"blk-16880","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-16119","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-16881","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-16120","text":"5) Cleanup Notes"}]},{"id":"blk-16882","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-16121","text":"The existing prompts are "},{"id":"spn-16122","marks":["bold"],"text":"not stale"},{"id":"spn-16123","text":" — they are current (March 2026) and technically precise. No cleanup needed on content. What would help:"}]},{"id":"blk-16883","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-16124","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-16125","marks":["bold"],"text":"Add frontmatter"},{"id":"spn-16126","text":" to each prompt (version, date, dependencies, target-app) 2. "},{"id":"spn-16127","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cross-link"},{"id":"spn-16128","text":" prompts to their corresponding project_spec 3. "},{"id":"spn-16129","marks":["bold"],"text":"Add milestone gates"},{"id":"spn-16130","text":" (\"what constitutes done\" per section) 4. "},{"id":"spn-16131","marks":["bold"],"text":"Break ATTENTION_ENGINE_PROMPT"},{"id":"spn-16132","text":" (1,335 lines) into Codex-sized chunks if Codex context windows are a constraint"}]},{"id":"blk-16884","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-16133","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-16885","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-16134","text":"6) Generation Workflow"}]},{"id":"blk-16886","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-16135","text":"When ready to generate a new Codex prompt:"}]},{"id":"blk-16887","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-16136","text":"1. Read the target app's "},{"id":"spn-16137","marks":["code"],"text":"project_spec/README.md"},{"id":"spn-16138","text":" 2. Read the relevant [&] capability contracts in "},{"id":"spn-16139","marks":["code"],"text":"AmpersandBoxDesign/contracts/v0.1.0/"},{"id":"spn-16140","text":" 3. Read "},{"id":"spn-16141","marks":["code"],"text":"PROTOCOL_PROMPT.md"},{"id":"spn-16142","text":" for ecosystem context 4. Use the template from §4 above 5. Save to "},{"id":"spn-16143","marks":["code"],"text":"AmpersandBoxDesign/prompts/[APP]_BUILD_PROMPT.md"},{"id":"spn-16144","text":" 6. Update this guide's inventory (§1)"}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieramvbn5pl4eszpepszs6nj6w4effinoinklpyjt2rhfdht3ue34ahq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}